{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eurekas</strong> is a real-time strategy colony sim with a mystical twist. A tribe of settlers has landed on a mysterious island, ready to claim it as their own\u2014but the land has other plans. Nature resists. Spirits stir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your colony in real time, harness arcane magic, and devise clever strategies to survive the island\u2019s wrath. Expand your territory, confront supernatural threats, and earn the favor of your gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As god you only have control over the tiles your world is made - Your colonist will live their own lives.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your colony thrive\u2014or be reclaimed by the wild?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897810?t=1756761603","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897810?t=1756761603","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897810/41ec10607e381272d95140bc9a2837c16461361c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756761603","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897810/41ec10607e381272d95140bc9a2837c16461361c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756761603","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eurekas</strong> is a real-time strategy colony sim with a mystical twist. A tribe of settlers has landed on a mysterious island, ready to claim it as their own\u2014but the land has other plans. Nature resists. Spirits stir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your colony in real time, harness arcane magic, and devise clever strategies to survive the island\u2019s wrath. Expand your territory, confront supernatural threats, and earn the favor of your gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As god yo